# every input of the mpv builds (deploy/builder/mpv.sh), each fetched by deploy/builder/mpv-fetch.sh and checked here:
#   file <name> <version> <url> <sha256>
#   git  <name> <version> <url> <full commit>   (fetched at that commit, with its submodules where marked +sub)
# mpv 0.40.0-3+deb13u1 (trixie's own) is the screens' default on linux: its debs replace the distro's libmpv2 with the
# same version line, so every package trixie built against libmpv2 still fits and a security update is a new pin;
# mpv 0.41.0-2 (forky's) builds the same way, for an api equal to android's.
# the pi's debs: debian's mpv source packages, from the snapshot the builders' apt uses (apt is not asked: these
# hashes are the dsc's own, as apt-get source would check them against the signed Release)
